{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Preserve the primary invocation-end failure when scope restoration also fails.** This plain `finally` lets `scope.close()` replace an `Error` from `endInvocation()`. `PluginRunner` may then isolate the replacement `RuntimeException`, losing a fatal span-finalization/flush failure and returning the settled outcome. Use try-with-resources or explicit suppression here and in the mirrored `ExecutionOtelPlugin`, with a combined-failure test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77JH6b","finding_digest":"c363bb8c54ba71696f80c58342afb5ddfdc45e48ae85f0e3522cda4e313eab46","finding_id":"arf_v1_ynr3xdcuxjyws34aywbufl5v3x","finding_key":"otel-plugin/invocationotelplugin::oninvocationend::scope-close-masks-primary-failure","identity_key":"otel-plugin/invocationotelplugin::oninvocationend::scope-close-masks-primary-failure","line":295,"observation_digest":"c9ebbfcb54318502f28f4f637b074b2163c47184b2529cb415be837f5b11a663","observation_id":"aro_v1_zhv37s2uggcqf4upj5rxwb2lef","path":"otel-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/otel/InvocationOtelPlugin.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-08T00:41:41Z","review_id":"arr_v1_ye7pcmvt4mspmdo2nmfqhgz2mp","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"cacd73056ff1cfcdb0f9e544531fa76f46ecd0a9","reviewer":"codex","start_line":290,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":771},"record_id":"art_v1_gr6ioj7conzbtpw3ytckjovwbg","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T00:41:41Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
